      ("Questions owners ask us", p("Owners often ask whether temporary threads hurt their visibility. They don't target businesses; they remove personal history from the answer, which makes public information more important. Another common question is whether businesses can see who searched in a temporary thread. No; the session isn't tied to the person's account. Owners also ask whether this changes SEO basics. No; it reinforces them.")),
      ("Gift and surprise purchases", p("Searches people want to keep private, such as gifts or surprises, are exactly where temporary threads are likely to be used. Gift shops, florists, jewelers and experience businesses should make gift ideas, price ranges and delivery or pickup options easy to find.")),
      ("Answer common questions directly", p("AI answers draw on pages that answer questions clearly. A short FAQ on each service or product page, answering what people ask before buying, gives AI Mode concise, accurate material to work with.")),
